  <!--EN: chanter present-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.0.label>{PAWN_labelShort} 的社会影响</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!--EN: participant count-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者人数</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!--EN: room impressiveness-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.2.label>参与者人数</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. A shanty of above average quality will provide a new quest. A good quality shanty will remove negative thoughts from losing someone for all participants.-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.description>根据仪式的质量，参与者将获得持续 4 小时到 3 天的娱乐提升，这将提高他们的娱乐标准。他们的情绪也会在 {MOODDAYS} 天内处于 {MINMOOD} 和 {MAXMOOD} 之间。

仪式篝火将持续点燃至少两个方格，提供附近的美丽奖励，并计入“火：所需戒律”周围的火的数量。</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} were incredibly boring. The cap'n displayed a lack of passion and the feeling of camaraderie just wasn't there.-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} 太糟糕了！一些可怜的小火焰四处飘荡，但它们很快就消失了（没有应用娱乐效果）。</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Boring-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} were lame. The cap'n treated us like children, wanting so desperately to hear something to lift their spirits.-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 表现平淡。我们原以为会发生一场奇妙的大火，但结果却是一场超大的篝火。至少还算有趣。

所有参与者的娱乐时间将提高4小时。</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Lame-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>黯淡无光</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} were very rousing. Shiver me timbers, those were some good shanties! The cap'n lifted our spirits and made us feel a camaraderie and togetherness that will only make us stronger.\n\nAnalyzing the lyrics afterwards, we found that the ancient words are actually cleverly encoded clues to a possible quest!-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 很好。定居点上空熊熊燃烧，火焰噼啪作响，极大地振奋了我们的士气。

所有参与者的娱乐活动将提高 1 天。</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Rousing-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>好的</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} were amazing! We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the cap'n, as they reminded us of the importance of our shared camaraderie. We can even feel our sadness vanish away.\n\nAnalyzing the lyrics afterwards, we found that the ancient words are actually cleverly encoded clues to a possible quest!-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 太棒了！这非常有趣，我们通过共同的经历真正建立了联系。

所有参与者的娱乐时间将提高 3 天。</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  <!--EN: Amazing-->
  <VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>辉煌</VFEP_SingingShantiesOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
</LanguageData>
